## Suggested sequencing

1. Lock [Action Schema](asset:e0f3dc31) + finalize [Actions Catalog](asset:a3a67c22) effects.
2. Pin economic formulas (the **Models** folder) + situation numbers.
3. Define agent input shape.
4. Pick stack + storage. Build tick loop with stub agent.
5. Wire real BYOK calls.
6. Bolt on throwaway GUI.
7. Playtest, tune, iterate.
